---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="programs-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 52px">
      <div class="eyebrow ctr">Our Programs</div>
      <h2 class="st bl">Healing Through Community</h2>
      <p
        style="
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #666;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 12px auto 0;
            line-height: 1.7;
          "
      >
        Every program under the Warrior Retreat umbrella is built around one truth: veterans heal
        better together than alone.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="prog-grid">
      <div class="prog-card">
        <div class="prog-num" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
        <img class="pc-logo" src={`${base}assets/cc71eaccc186820e.webp`} alt="Warrior Retreat" />
        <div class="pc-eyebrow">Flagship Program</div>
        <div class="pc-title">The Warrior Retreat</div>
        <p class="pc-body">
          AV's Warrior Retreats offer veterans a four-day fellowship for healing trauma through
          Post-Traumatic Growth and Wellbeing. A structured environment of brotherhood, reflection,
          and real healing.
        </p>
        <p
          class="pc-body"
          style="
              font-size: 13px;
              background: rgba(72, 83, 106, 0.07);
              padding: 10px 14px;
              border-left: 3px solid var(--red);
            "
        >
          <strong>Separate retreats for men and women</strong> — each designed for the unique experiences
          veterans carry based on their service and gender.
        </p>
        <p class="pc-body">
          Recreational activities are combined with therapeutic experiences to create a supportive
          environment for self-reflection and processing the struggles that come home with service.
        </p>
        <div class="pc-activities">
          <span class="pc-act">Fishing</span><span class="pc-act">Shooting</span><span
            class="pc-act">Kayaking</span
          ><span class="pc-act">Art Therapy</span><span class="pc-act">Group Sessions</span>
        </div>
        <a href={`${base}warrior-retreat-application/`} class="btn-r">Apply Now</a>
      </div>
      <div class="prog-card dark">
        <div class="prog-num" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
        <div class="pc-eyebrow">Marriage &amp; Family</div>
        <div class="pc-title">The Marriage Retreat</div>
        <p class="pc-body">
          Marriage Retreats' retreats acknowledge the unique transitions and traumas experienced by
          veterans' spouses, aiming to counter the high divorce rates among combat veterans.
        </p>
        <p class="pc-body">
          The program fosters connection, open communication, reconciliation, and mutual respect —
          equipping couples with the education, tools, and support needed to navigate their PTG
          journey and renew their partnership.
        </p>
        <div class="pc-activities">
          <span class="pc-act">Couples Therapy</span><span class="pc-act">Communication Tools</span
          ><span class="pc-act">PTG Framework</span><span class="pc-act">Shared Activities</span>
        </div>
        <a href={`${base}warrior-retreat-application/`} class="btn-r">Apply Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="prog-full" style="margin-top: 3px; background: var(--off)">
      <div class="prog-full-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="pc-eyebrow" style="color: var(--red)">Challenge Program</div>
          <div class="pc-title" style="color: var(--blue)">The Endurance Retreat</div>
          <p class="pc-body">
            The Endurance Retreat is built for veterans who are ready to push their limits —
            physically and mentally. Inspired by military training culture, this retreat combines
            high-intensity physical challenges with the same PTG framework that powers every Warrior
            Retreat.
          </p>
          <p class="pc-body">
            Participants work as a team through demanding outdoor activities designed to build
            resilience, trust, and a renewed sense of purpose. The mission: prove to yourself what
            you're still capable of.
          </p>
          <div class="pc-activities">
            <span class="pc-act">Ruck Marches</span><span class="pc-act">Obstacle Challenges</span
            ><span class="pc-act">Team Missions</span><span class="pc-act">PTG Framework</span><span
              class="pc-act">Leadership Development</span
            >
          </div>
          <a href={`${base}warrior-retreat-application/`} class="btn-r">Apply Now</a>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img
            src={`${base}assets/bef57b4b7e1a4ea9.webp`}
            alt="AV Endurance Retreat"
            style="width: 100%; height: 320px; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 30%"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="prog-full dark" style="margin-top: 3px">
      <div class="prog-full-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="pc-eyebrow">Community Support</div>
          <div class="pc-title">Peer-to-Peer Programs</div>
          <p class="pc-body">
            Our AV peer-to-peer (P2P) support programs, peer-led by veteran peer-support
            specialists, offer mentoring, camaraderie, and a genuine sense of belonging.
          </p>
          <p class="pc-body">
            Individual and group sessions are held at safe locations statewide — a force multiplier
            for everything else we do. Veterans helping veterans navigate the hardest parts of the
            transition.
          </p>
          <div style="margin-top: 28px">
            <a
              href="https://app.alabamaveteran.org/widget/form/oA6BYtFTZ47lbNChjt2h?notrack=true"
              class="btn-r"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Get Involved</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img
            src="https://alabamaveteran.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/your-next-mission-2.webp"
            alt="Veterans connecting"
            style="width: 100%; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="prog-full" style="margin-top: 3px">
      <div class="prog-full-grid">
        <div>
          <img
            src={`${base}assets/3860a43bcac62759.webp`}
            alt="AV Ambassador"
            style="width: 100%; height: 280px; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 40%"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="pc-eyebrow" style="color: var(--red)">Volunteer Program</div>
          <div class="pc-title" style="color: var(--blue)">AV Ambassador Program</div>
          <p class="pc-body">
            The AV Ambassador Program (AVAP) engages veterans statewide through mentoring, outdoor
            activities, and resource facilitation. Ambassadors are the primary way Alabama Veteran
            reaches veterans in every corner of the state.
          </p>
          <p class="pc-body" style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue)">Be Someone’s 9-Line.</p>
          <ul class="duties-list">
            <li>Peer counseling and facilitating peer groups</li>
            <li>Recruiting volunteers and coordinating outdoor events</li>
            <li>Offering follow-up support to veterans in need</li>
            <li>Representing AV at outreach events statewide</li>
            <li>Connecting veterans in crisis with immediate assistance</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="nine-box">
            <strong>What is the 9-Line?</strong>
            <p>
              In combat, the 9-Line report provides the critical information needed in seconds to
              collect a wounded warrior and get them to the next level of care. Alabama Veteran uses
              this same principle for veterans in crisis — providing immediate connection to
              housing, food, clothing, and support. Ambassadors are trained to be that lifeline.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top: 28px">
            <a
              href="https://app.alabamaveteran.org/widget/form/oA6BYtFTZ47lbNChjt2h?notrack=true"
              class="btn-r"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Become an Ambassador</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="prog-full dark" style="margin-top: 3px">
      <div class="prog-full-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="pc-eyebrow">Get Involved</div>
          <div class="pc-title">Volunteer With Alabama Veteran</div>
          <p class="pc-body">
            Our programs only exist because Alabamians show up. Whether you’re helping at a retreat,
            working an event like War on the Greens or Motors on Main, or simply spreading the word
            — every hand matters.
          </p>
          <p class="pc-body">
            Alabama Veteran is powered by volunteers, and there’s a place for you regardless of your
            background or availability.
          </p>
          <div style="margin-top: 28px">
            <a
              href="https://app.alabamaveteran.org/widget/form/oA6BYtFTZ47lbNChjt2h?notrack=true"
              class="btn-r"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Volunteer Now</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          style="
              display: flex;
              flex-direction: column;
              justify-content: center;
              gap: 16px;
              padding: 40px;
            "
        >
          <div
            style="
                color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 2px;
                text-transform: uppercase;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
              "
          >
            Ways to Help
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px">
            <span class="pc-act">Retreat Support</span><span class="pc-act">Event Volunteers</span
            ><span class="pc-act">Outreach</span><span class="pc-act">Administrative</span><span
              class="pc-act">Fundraising</span
            ><span class="pc-act">No Experience Needed</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
